/E ( The core of the transformer is this 'self-attention'. The reason the word 'self' is attached is because the sentence applies attention to 'itself \(other words in the sentence\)' rather than external information to understand the context.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
