/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 954 0 R
/E (For example, in the sentence "The animal didn't cross the street because it was too tired.", does 'it' refer to 'animal' or 'street'? People can easily tell that 'it' refers to 'animal' through the context. Self-attention allows the machine to do exactly this. When processing 'it', it calculates the relationship with other words in the sentence such as 'animal' and 'street' and determines that the word most closely related to 'it' is 'animal'.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
