/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Since the transformer does not have a cyclic structure, it does not know the order of the words. "I love you" and "you love me" have the same words, but their order is different, and their meanings are completely different. Self-attention alone cannot distinguish this difference.)
/Alt ()
