<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To solve this, the transformer adds a special vector called 'position encoding' to the embedding vector of each word. This position encoding vector is created using the sine and cosine functions, and contains unique position information for each word. This allows the model to understand the relative and absolute positions of the words and understand their order.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
